    "status": "accepted",
    "notes": "H3 video. The first hit and death takes spray seeds the actions never ask for; retakes that tip the launcher muzzle down and say it is never fired are clean, and the hit drops one frame with a pink muzzle flicker. The first walk's plate dims on every downbeat and a third of it fails to matte; a retake padded at the sides is clean and loops on two wingbeats. The attack skips the muzzle burst and the seed spray and snaps from the raised wind-up into the shove. The ranged jumps from sighting to the recoil so the seed is never shown. The defend flares the wings and folds into the crouch, ending before the plate pulses and the launcher fires."
